    "gate_0xba01fc": "When zero, AC60 performs setup/lock, rasterizes groups 0x20 and 0x60, then remaps pixels/unlocks/presents. When nonzero those actions are skipped. E1/page, move/bitmap, F3/clip processing and final callback still run.",
    "optional_color_update": "If byte 0x96e698 is nonzero on the enabled path, call 0x6ee0 with low bytes 0x96e699, 0x96e69a, 0x96e69b, then call 0x6ff0 to lock the surface.",
    "texture_page_cells": [
